[crw] External skill catalogs are searchable on demand. Priority: jaw (cli-jaw-skills, 1st-class, default) > clawhub (2nd) > hermes (3rd, sparse). When a task needs a capability you do not have loaded, browse `dev/references/skill-catalog.md` for the full jaw catalog first, or run `crw skill search <query>` then `crw skill show <id>` to load it (adapter preamble applies; crw-dev discipline wins on conflict).
